{"id":"n16756-2-7","stage":3,"title":"상관 · 干预","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16756-2-7-1","ko":"네가 하는 방법이 틀린 것 같은데 말이야.","zh":"我觉得你用的方法好像不对哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"하는","meaning":"以某种方式构成行为。","explanation":"하다：以某种方式构成行为；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"25","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하는","audio":"/audio/db405bc1ba8346522533.mp3"}},{"text":"방법이","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방법이","audio":"/audio/6580a6d0ccbaed8b795b.mp3"}},{"text":"틀린","meaning":"错，错误","explanation":"틀리다：错，错误；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"틀리다","audio":"/audio/5bbafb331d40a891bb62.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71481","senseId":"1","lemma":"틀리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"틀린","audio":"/audio/18e410ca770ed6acab2f.mp3"}},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}},{"text":"같은데","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"같은데","audio":"/audio/09d1b4825a769d691604.mp3"}},{"text":"말이야.","meaning":"声，声音","explanation":"말：声，声音；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"1","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말이야","audio":"/audio/fd5a3f00cd7342725148.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"以某种方式构成行为。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"以某种方式构成行为。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"a4a801d526fb2511","term":"방법","zh":"方法，办法","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3","entryId":"65531","definition":"处理某事的手段或方式。","pronunciation":["방법"]},{"id":"5bbafb331d40a891","term":"틀리다","zh":"错，错误","audio":"/audio/5bbafb331d40a891bb62.mp3","entryId":"71481","definition":"计算或答案、事实等不正确。","pronunciation":["틀리다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"dfbb3ea79fc80c6f","term":"말","zh":"声，声音","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3","entryId":"27260","definition":"表达想法或感觉的人的声响。","pronunciation":["말ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/c89fefe68903bfe453fb.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16756-2-7-2","ko":"네가 상관을 할 일이 아니니 관심 끄렴.","zh":"这不是你该管的事，别再操心了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"상관을","meaning":"干预","explanation":"상관：干预；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"상관","audio":"/audio/7c0b2b950f7b18554a71.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16756","senseId":"2","lemma":"상관","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상관을","audio":"/audio/d20261a26838c74b7686.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"아니니","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"아니니","audio":"/audio/beb7172989a48b62ccd6.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아니니","audio":"/audio/beb7172989a48b62ccd6.mp3"}},{"text":"관심","meaning":"关注，关心，兴趣","explanation":"관심：关注，关心，兴趣。","readings":[{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60096","senseId":"1","lemma":"관심","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"관심","audio":"/audio/07b3c15a29688a55c61b.mp3"}},{"text":"끄렴.","meaning":"停止关注（관심을 끄다：不再关心、别操心）","explanation":"끄다：停止关注（관심을 끄다：不再关心、别操心）；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"끄다","audio":"/audio/1e0c0d787abf4da9e67d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73443","senseId":"2","lemma":"끄다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"끄렴","audio":"/a